  "language_raw": "Spanish",
  "source": "message/dat/Spanish/script/sdc01_0040.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Spanish/script/sdc01_0040.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student1_01",
      "hash64": "8EF4D37E104353CA",
      "text": "¡Por fin! ¡Hemos llegado!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student2_01",
      "hash64": "3CE71399CB93CFBD",
      "text": "Me duele todo el cuerpo, de verdad. Entre el\\nviaje en avión y luego todo el trecho en bus...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "EC547B8D853E0202",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! Bueno, lo importante es que ya\\nestamos aquí.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "EC547A8D853E004F",
      "text": "No falta nadie, ¿verdad? ¿Estamos todos?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_students_01",
      "hash64": "BD78057B68BC1668",
      "text": "¡Síii!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "EC54798D853DFE9C",
      "text": "En ese caso... ¡Bienvenidos a Noroteo![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "EC54788D853DFCE9",
      "text": "¡La comarca que nos acogerá durante el\\ncampamento![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "EC54778D853DFB36",
      "text": "También es mi primera vez visitando estas tierras.\\n¡Mirad qué maravilla de arrozales![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "EC54768D853DF983",
      "text": "Un poco más adelante se encuentra Villa Versui.\\nSerá donde nos estableceremos durante el viaje.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student3_01",
      "hash64": "6765878E822BE528",
      "text": "Seño... No me encuentro bien...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "EC54758D853DF7D0",
      "text": "¡Ay, vaya! Se me ha mareado esta criatura.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_08",
      "hash64": "EC54848D853E114D",
      "text": "Pues nada, chicos, ¿por qué no nos tomamos\\nun descansito en este paisaje tan pintoresco?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_09",
      "hash64": "EC54838D853E0F9A",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)], un segundo.\\n¿Te puedo pedir un favor?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_10",
      "hash64": "EC50F68D853AEA2C",
      "text": "¿Podrías ir a avisar de nuestra llegada al\\nencargado del albergue turístico de Villa Versui?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_11",
      "hash64": "EC50F78D853AEBDF",
      "text": "Y, de paso, coméntale que tenemos a un alumno\\nindispuesto.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_select_01",
      "hash64": "0B5A1531CC6F91AC",
      "text": "De acuerdo",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_select_02",
      "hash64": "0B5A1831CC6F96C5",
      "text": "¡Yo me encargo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_bbteacher_12",
      "hash64": "EC50F88D853AED92",
      "text": "¡Me sacas de un aprieto! Con el pequeño malo,\\ncreo que será mejor que me quede aquí con él.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student1_02",
      "hash64": "8EF4D27E10435217",
      "text": "¡Nunca había estado en el extranjero!\\nHasta el aire huele distinto...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student2_02",
      "hash64": "3CE71099CB93CAA4",
      "text": "Espero que se le pase pronto el mareo...\\nEl camino estaba lleno de baches.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0040_student3_02",
      "hash64": "67658A8E822BEA41",
      "text": "Ay, mi cabeza... Ahora entiendo cómo se sienten\\nlos Psyduck...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
